{"id":"01a046b0-9a39-7f3e-8d45-ac772adcc614","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-5oop.2","event_type":"closed","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"","new_value":"The described O(n) peer scan vulnerability does not exist in the current implementation. The receive_frame path (lines 1085-1223) uses O(1) HashMap lookup via self.peers.get(\u0026signer_iid) based on the signer EUI-64 from the frame header, then performs exactly one signature verification. There is no iteration over peers. The timing is constant with respect to peer count.","created_at":"2026-08-28T04:46:14.074Z"}
